        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: No. 22 Squadron RAAF\n- Events: Pacific War, Second World War\n- Places: Papua New Guinea, Philippines, Pacific, East Asia\n\nFacts:\n- No. 22 Squadron RAAF was formed in 1936.\n- During the Second World War, No. 22 Squadron RAAF served in Papua New Guinea.\n- No. 22 Squadron RAAF later followed the Pacific War as far as the Philippines.\n- The Pacific War, sometimes called the Asia-Pacific War, was the theater of the Second World War fought in the Pacific and East Asia.",
